# Line endings and binary safety.
#
# This file must land in the repository BEFORE gradle/wrapper/gradle-wrapper.jar and before any
# filesystem image fixture. With core.autocrlf=true on Windows — the default for many installs —
# git will otherwise rewrite CRLF inside those binaries and corrupt them.

*               text eol=lf
*.bat           text eol=crlf
*.cmd           text eol=crlf

*.jar           binary
*.zip           binary
*.gz            binary
*.png           binary
*.webp          binary
*.keystore      binary
*.jks           binary

# Filesystem image fixtures for the FR-920 reference corpus.
*.img           binary
*.bin           binary
